/* =====================================================================
   EVENTS.JS — 239 of the world's biggest festivals, pilgrimages,
   sporting finals and seasonal spectacles, for the World Events picker
   on choose.html.

   Compiled from the "Events" tab of NRA-MASTER.xlsx (visitor-scale
   research, August 2026). tier is Mega/Large/Iconic by rough scale;
   category is one of Religious, Cultural/Tradition, Music, Arts,
   Food/Beverage, Seasonal, Sports, Bucket List.

   months    = Gregorian month name(s) parsed out of the "dates" text
               (best-effort; movable/lunar-calendar events with no
               explicit Gregorian month are left empty and only show
               up under the "All" view, not a specific month filter).
   countries = country name(s) parsed out of the "location" text
               (best-effort keyword match against a fixed country
               list; a handful of events genuinely span >1 country).

   img   = a local file under images/events/ (downloaded from each
           event's Wikipedia/Wikimedia Commons photo, August 2026).
   page  = the Wikipedia/Wikimedia Commons file page (photo credit link).
   label = which service to credit under the photo ("Wikipedia" or
           "Wikimedia Commons").
   One event (Crop Over / Grand Kadooment) has no free-license photo
   available and falls back to the card's placeholder styling.
   ===================================================================== */

